    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "After losing its home, one lonely <i>Wum</i> must travel the length and width of the world to find a new place to live. From the metropolitan haven <i>Popocity</i> to the cavernous <i>Bliekopolis</i>, our Wum will discover magical places and encounter strange creatures. But this <i>Wum</i> is no traditional hero and only by using wit and charm can it succeed in this massive journey. <br><br>Wuppo is a two man passion project, with hand-drawn visuals, an extensive soundtrack and a huge world to explore.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">FEATURES<li>Explore a wondrous world filled with <i>Wums</i>, <i>Fnakkers</i> and other strange creatures.<br></li><li>Resolve an ancient conflict on your quest for a new home. <br></li><li>Use items and social skills to overcome diverse challenges.<br></li><li>Fight numerous enemies, ranging from small, to big, to MASSIVE!<br></li><li>Collect filmstrips to discover the world's detailed history.<br></li><li>Enjoy an enchanting and memorable orchestrated soundtrack.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "After losing its home, one lonely <i>Wum</i> must travel the length and width of the world to find a new place to live. From the metropolitan haven <i>Popocity</i> to the cavernous <i>Bliekopolis</i>, our Wum will discover magical places and encounter strange creatures. But this <i>Wum</i> is no traditional hero and only by using wit and charm can it succeed in this massive journey. <br><br>Wuppo is a two man passion project, with hand-drawn visuals, an extensive soundtrack and a huge world to explore.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">FEATURES<li>Explore a wondrous world filled with <i>Wums</i>, <i>Fnakkers</i> and other strange creatures.<br></li><li>Resolve an ancient conflict on your quest for a new home. <br></li><li>Use items and social skills to overcome diverse challenges.<br></li><li>Fight numerous enemies, ranging from small, to big, to MASSIVE!<br></li><li>Collect filmstrips to discover the world's detailed history.<br></li><li>Enjoy an enchanting and memorable orchestrated soundtrack.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play as an exiled 'wum' looking for a new home in this bizarre but charming world, filled with strange creatures, puzzles, monsters and political chaos.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Japanese, German, Russian, Turkish",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt\u2019s a game full of those playful \u201cthey thought of that?\u201d touches that make Deus Ex or Paper Mario titles rewarding.\u201d<br>RockPaperShotgun<br><br>\u201cWuppo, the most overlooked &quot;hidden gem&quot; on Steam\u201d<br>PCgamer<br><br>\u201c...this is something a game hasn\u2019t done to me since Zelda: The Ocarina of Time, Morrowind or Fez.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 Brash Games<br>",
